	(text "Spectrum analyzer, 0.1 MHz to 6.4 GHz.  Low band to 3 GHz by a 3.4 GHz first IF; high band converted directly; 0.1 to 15 MHz sampled directly.\nThe signal runs left to right along the middle row.  Controls and clock references are joined by name: a bus stub carries the same name at both ends.\nDesign, simulation and what it gives up: sim/README.md.  How this schematic is made and what is still open: docs/schematic.md."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
